## Edge Cases & Solutions

| Edge Case | Solution |
|-----------|----------|
| **Queue fills during burst** | Flush immediately when hitting `maxBatchSize` |
| **Python crashes mid-batch** | Accept loss (memory system is best-effort), retry on reconnect |
| **Gateway restarts** | `drain()` on shutdown hook to flush remaining items |
| **Concurrent flush calls** | `isFlushing` lock prevents double-processing |
| **Items queued during flush** | Schedule new flush after current completes |

