## 5. SQLite-Specific Gotchas

### 🔴 SQLITE_MAX_COMPOUND_SELECT Limit

Default limit is **500 UNION terms**. With monthly partitions, this means ~41 years before hitting the limit.

**Mitigation** - Document and add guard:
```typescript
private rebuildView(): void {
  if (this.currentPartitions.size > 400) {
    log.error(`Too many partitions (${this.currentPartitions.size}) - approaching SQLITE_MAX_COMPOUND_SELECT limit`);
    // Consider archiving old partitions instead
  }
  // ...
}
```

### 🟡 WAL Mode Checkpoint Before Migration

