// Track migration
db.prepare(`
  INSERT INTO _partition_schema (version, config_json)
  VALUES (1, ?)
`).run(JSON.stringify({ retentionMonths: 12 }));
```

### 🟡 Thread Safety with Shared Connections

If the database connection is shared across threads (worker threads), the in-memory `currentPartitions` set could become stale.

**Mitigation**:
```typescript
private scanPartitions(): void {
  // Always scan fresh from DB
  const tables = this.db
    .prepare("SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' AND name LIKE 'agent_events_%'")
    .all() as { name: string }[];

  this.currentPartitions = new Set(tables.map(t => t.name));
}
```

